  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Support to the Ministry of Interior of Montenegro to Upgrade its IT Infrastructure</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With the overall objective to contribute to more effective functionality of IT systems within the Ministry of Interior of Montenegro and proficient service provision, this intervention is intended to renew the technical infrastructure that will support swift and efficient information and data processing. The project will enhance capacities of respective departments within the MoI through procurement of specified technical equipment that will advance the overall workflow. Namely, this project will focus on the procurement of computers, printers and scanners as requested by the Ministry of Interior and in line with technical specifications provided. Therefore, upon completion of this project the Ministry of Interior of Montenegro will demonstrate improved ability to manage efficient data processing and information flow, entailing the achievement of the project&#x2019;s Outcome by strengthening technical capacities of the Ministry of Interior to upgrade its quality of services.</narrative>
  </description>
